<view class="settings-container">
  <view class="section">
    <text class="section-title">传输速度</text>
    <text class="section-hint">全部档位均采用 ACK 闭环：等设备敲完再发下一包，速度由七键间隔决定。点击即保存。</text>
    <view class="option-group">
      <view class="option-card {{speedMode === 'slow' ? 'option-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectSpeed" data-speed="slow">
        <text class="option-name">慢速</text>
        <text class="option-desc">ACK 闭环，七键 100ms/键，空格前 30ms，最稳。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="option-card {{speedMode === 'safe' ? 'option-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectSpeed" data-speed="safe">
        <text class="option-name">稳定</text>
        <text class="option-desc">ACK 闭环，七键 50ms/键，空格前 20ms，推荐日常使用。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="option-card {{speedMode === 'balanced' ? 'option-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectSpeed" data-speed="balanced">
        <text class="option-name">均衡</text>
        <text class="option-desc">ACK 闭环，七键 12ms/键，空格前 10ms，速度与稳定性折中。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="option-card {{speedMode === 'turbo' ? 'option-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectSpeed" data-speed="turbo">
        <text class="option-name">快速</text>
        <text class="option-desc">ACK 闭环，七键连打，空格前 5ms，仅性能好的电脑可用。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
